flowchart LR
    A[session begin on deck] --> B[load due card ids ordered by due date]
    B --> C[show current card front with alg hidden]
    C --> D[user reveals alg]
    D --> E[grade again hard good or easy]
    E --> F[fsrs review updates stability difficulty and due]
    F --> G[persist srs row and review log]
    G --> H{next due card}
    H -- yes --> C
    H -- no --> I[write session log and end]
